  "selector": ".tour",
  "description": "The first-run tour: a coachmark that points at one thing while everything else on the screen fades to 20%. Home steps 1 to 3 and Start together point at the chat box, Bite Size Support and Recent Topics; the chat steps point at the record button (the recap, then off the record).",
